      <div type="clause" n="38">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIAtr">VI Atr</ref> 38</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gif hwa forsteal ongean lahriht Cristes oþþe cyninges ahwar gewyrce, gylde wer oþþe wite be þam þe seo dæd sy; ⁊ gif he geonbyrde ⁊ sylf gewyrce þæt hine man afylle, licge ægylde.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if anyone is guilty of offering obstruction anywhere to the law of Christ or the king, he shall pay either wergeld or fine according to the nature of the offence, and if he offers resistance and so acts as to bring about his own death, no compensation shall be paid for him.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">[Not in D]</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
